# KI-006: First-order half-life is tested by changing initial substrate, not the clock
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
add v1 MnO2 0.001g
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H2O2 0.002mol
add v2 MnO2 0.001g
wait 10s
inspect
wait 20s
inspect
wait 40s
inspect
